    <string name="empty_title">No stickers yet</string>
    <string name="empty_body">Whatik collects the stickers you grab from TikTok, converts them to WhatsApp\'s format and adds them as packs. Copy one at a time or all at once.</string>
    <string name="empty_step1">In TikTok long-press the sticker (or image) and choose Save, or Share → Whatik.</string>
    <string name="empty_step2">If you saved it to the gallery, use "Find TikTok stickers on this phone": it locates TikTok\'s folder for you.</string>
    <string name="empty_step3">Tap stickers to select them, or use "Select all" to copy them in bulk.</string>
    <string name="empty_step4">Press "Copy to WhatsApp": packs are created and opened in WhatsApp (3 to 30 stickers per pack).</string>
